    "text": "Victoria\nFireworks And Fun Await At Victoria Community Center This July 4th\n9 hours ago\nIt's always fun when the Fourth of July falls on a Friday. As always, the City of Victoria is hosting a big Fourth of July celebration at the Victoria Community Center Fairgrounds. The celebration is scheduled for Friday, July 4, from 3:30-10:30 p.m. Get ready for live music and fireworks:",
